     A*****************************************************************
     A*  WORKERS' COMP LARGE DEDUCTIBLE DISCOUNT MASTER FILE          *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A*  DESC:     THIS FILE CONTAINS A RECORD FOR EACH POLICY        *
     A*            WRITTEN AS A LARGE DEDUCTIBLE POLICY, TO CONTAIN   *
     A*            THE DETAILS OF THE LARGE DEDUCTIBLE PLAN.  THERE   *
     A*            ARE A SET OF FIELDS FOR 1ST AND 2ND DEDUCTIBLE.    *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  PROJECT:  WC1838            PROGRAMMER:  C:65                *
     A*  CREATED:  11/30/09                                           *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 11/26/24 C:291 Peoject: 148WFA                                *
     A*                Add Mega Deductible Threshold.                 *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 09/02/20 C:180 PROJECT: WC2733                                *
     A*                ADD INCLUDE MEDICAL OR INDEMNITY CLAIMS FLAG   *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 09/15/17 C:180 PROJECT: 150WBL                                *
     A*                ADD VARIABLE AGGREGATE AMOUNT INDICATOR.       *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  08/10/17 C:180 Project 150WAV - Add Deductible Aggregate %.  *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  05/16/12 C:255 Project SY275 Priss#13.                       *
     A*                 Files were not present in V12 Production. Che-*
     A*                 cked out in V12 and promoted. (No changes).   *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  01/28/11 C:190 Project: WC1954                               *
     A*                 Added field to contain state for setting up   *
     A*                 default values.                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  02/05/10 C:65  Project: 25WRB                                *
     A*                 Added 'CLAIM ALLOWANCE AMOUNT'                *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  01/14/10 C:191 Project: 25WRC                                *
     A*                 Added 'Claim Liability Rate'                  *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PLD01                     TEXT('LARGE DED DISCOUNT FILE')
     A            LDCO#     R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A            LDFND     R     S         REFFLD(FND)
     A            LDEMP#    R     S         REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            LDDIV     R     S         REFFLD(DIV)
     A            LDFYR     R     S         REFFLD(FYR)
     A*
     A            LDEFD1    R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('EFFECTIVE' 'DATE' '#1')
     A            LDEXP1    R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('EXPIRATION' 'DATE' '#1')
     A            LDDES1    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A                                      COLHDG('DESCRIPTION' '#1')
     A            LDPCT1        12S 9       COLHDG('DISCOUNT PERCENTAGE' '#1')
     A            LDTYP1    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('GROSS/NET' 'TYPE' '#1')
     A            LDAMP1    R     S         REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('AMT PER' 'OCCUR/CLAIM' '#1')
